{"verse_key": "10:68", "surah": 10, "verse": 68, "text_uthmani": "قَالُوا۟ ٱتَّخَذَ ٱللَّهُ وَلَدًا ۗ سُبْحَـٰنَهُۥ ۖ هُوَ ٱلْغَنِىُّ ۖ لَهُۥ مَا فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَمَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ إِنْ عِندَكُم مِّن سُلْطَـٰنٍۭ بِهَـٰذَآ ۚ أَتَقُولُونَ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ مَا لَا تَعْلَمُونَ", "translation": "They<sup foot_note=196454>1</sup> have said, \"Allāh has taken a son.\" Exalted is He; He is the [one] Free of need. To Him belongs whatever is in the heavens and whatever is in the earth. You have no authority<sup foot_note=196453>2</sup> for this [claim]. Do you say about Allāh that which you do not know?", "verse_from_ms": 1525430, "verse_to_ms": 1550190, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "قَالُوا۟", "start_ms": 1525430, "end_ms": 1526130}, {"i": 1, "text": "ٱتَّخَذَ", "start_ms": 1526130, "end_ms": 1526930}, {"i": 2, "text": "ٱللَّهُ", "start_ms": 1526930, "end_ms": 1527740}, {"i": 3, "text": "وَلَدًا", "start_ms": 1527740, "end_ms": 1529440}, {"i": 4, "text": "ۗ", "start_ms": 1529440, "end_ms": 1530980}, {"i": 5, "text": "سُبْحَـٰنَهُۥ", "start_ms": 1530980, "end_ms": 1531230}, {"i": 6, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 1531230, "end_ms": 1532330}, {"i": 7, "text": "هُوَ", "start_ms": 1532330, "end_ms": 1532940}, {"i": 8, "text": "ٱلْغَنِىُّ", "start_ms": 1532940, "end_ms": 1533290}, {"i": 9, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 1533290, "end_ms": 1533520}, {"i": 10, "text": "لَهُۥ", "start_ms": 1533520, "end_ms": 1534930}, {"i": 11, "text": "مَا", "start_ms": 1534930, "end_ms": 1535510}, {"i": 12, "text": "فِى", "start_ms": 1535510, "end_ms": 1535750}, {"i": 13, "text": "ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ", "start_ms": 1535750, "end_ms": 1537310}, {"i": 14, "text": "وَمَا", "start_ms": 1537310, "end_ms": 1537600}, {"i": 15, "text": "فِى", "start_ms": 1537600, "end_ms": 1539120}, {"i": 16, "text": "ٱلْأَرْضِ", "start_ms": 1539120, "end_ms": 1540350}, {"i": 17, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 1540350, "end_ms": 1542010}, {"i": 18, "text": "إ